{# =============================================================================
   arp_table.csv.j2
   Dependency-free CSV for the parsed ARP table. The play passes the parsed list
   of dicts as "rows" via copy: content="{{ lookup('template', ...) }}".

   One header line, then one comma-joined data line per dict. The ARP fields
   (ip, mac, type, interface) contain NO commas on Edge-core firmware, so no
   RFC-4180 quoting/escaping is needed here. If you adapt this example to
   firmware whose values can contain commas, add quoting.
   ============================================================================= #}
ip,mac,type,interface
{% for r in rows %}
{{ r.ip }},{{ r.mac }},{{ r.type }},{{ r.interface }}
{% endfor %}
